# GitHub portfolio

This project is the owner's public portfolio, published as a GitHub Pages site from `mrameen/mrameen.github.io`.

- Treat every change as something a visitor and a recruiter will see on GitHub.
- Keep the site presentable: clear structure, readable copy, and a layout that works on desktop and mobile.
- Prefer a static site that GitHub Pages can serve from this repo (HTML, CSS, JS, or a static build committed for Pages).
- Do not add private notes, credentials, or draft content that should not be public.
- Match the owner's voice when they write in Malay; site copy can be English unless they ask otherwise.
